&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Shift delivers AI agents that transform insurers&#39; most critical work. By combining deep industry expertise and unmatched data resources, Shift provides proven results that have earned the trust of hundreds of the world&#39;s leading insurers. Our insurance-grade AI is accurate, explainable, and secure—empowering human experts to move with unmatched speed, total confidence, and a renewed focus on the people they serve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;video poster=&quot;https://8595762.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/8595762/2026%20Website%20Refresh/2026%20Shift%20Brand%20Video/thumbnail-violet.jpg&quot; controls=&quot;controls&quot; width=&quot;300&quot; height=&quot;150&quot;&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;source src=&quot;https://8595762.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/8595762/2026%20Website%20Refresh/2026%20Shift%20Brand%20Video/2026%20Shift%20Brand%20Video%20(English).mp4&quot; type=&quot;video/mp4&quot;&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Your browser does not support the video tag.&lt;/video&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Our culture is built on innovation, trust, and a drive to transform the insurance industry through our SaaS platform. We come from more than 50 different countries and cultures and together we are creating the future of insurance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.shift-technology.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.shift-technology.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shift Technology :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shift is the leading AI platform for insurance. Shift combines generative, agentic, and predictive AI to detect fraud, assess risk, and recommend actions throughout the claims process. Our teams tackle complex data challenges and bring advanced models into production at scale, giving insurers deeper insights into their data while helping their customers get paid faster and enjoy a smoother claims experience. Our technology is adopted and trusted by the world’s leading insurers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Software Engineering Team 💻:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Software Engineering team designs, builds, and maintains the applications and services that Shift’s teams rely on every day. We are Software Engineers working across the full stack, from user interfaces to back-end services. Here are just a few of the areas we work on:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Front-end applications and user interfaces, mainly in React;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Back-end services and APIs, mainly in C#;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal tools that make the daily work of our Data Scientists simpler and faster;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software architecture, code quality, and reliable delivery to production;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close collaboration with Product, UX, and Data Science teams to turn real needs into working software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Product managers, UX designers, and Data Scientists, we take end-to-end ownership of what we build: from understanding the need and designing the solution to developing, deploying, and improving it over time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your key responsibilities🧑‍💻:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll lead the development of an internal project, from the first idea to a working product: a tool that helps our Data Scientists create and manage the JSON configuration files of Shift’s product features. Today these files are written by hand and are hard to read and maintain. You’ll build an interface where users select the values they need, and the tool generates the files for them. The scope is open, so you will shape it with your users. You’ll be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meeting our internal clients, the Data Scientists, to understand how they work today and define what the tool should do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with Product and UX teams to turn these needs into clear requirements and a simple user experience, without ready-made mock-ups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and building the front end of the tool in React, so that users can select values and see clear, guided options for each feature&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing the back-end services that validate the choices and generate the JSON configuration files&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharing your progress with developers and stakeholders, and collecting feedback to improve the tool&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploying the tool and maintaining it, so that it keeps saving time for the Data Science teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Along the way, you’ll discover how Engineering, Product, UX, and Data Science work together, and what the role of a developer is across all these technical jobs. This is a project you will own: you’ll learn to manage it, communicate about it, and deliver it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your profile and requirements✅:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are currently enrolled in an engineering school or university program in Computer Science or Software Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have solid skills in &lt;strong&gt;React&lt;/strong&gt; and/or &lt;strong&gt;C#&lt;/strong&gt;, and you understand &lt;strong&gt;Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)&lt;/strong&gt;. Experience with another language, such as Java, is welcome if you are ready to learn ours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong engineering mindset, with an interest in code quality, software design, and building both front-end and back-end features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are autonomous and curious, you like to learn new tools, and you communicate clearly with technical and non-technical colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can provide a 6-month internship agreement (&lt;em&gt;Convention de stage&lt;/em&gt;) signed by your school/university, starting around February 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language requirements:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; is mandatory at a fluent level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join Shift Technology as a Full Stack Engineer Intern?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤸‍♀️Flexibility, autonomy&amp;nbsp; and adaptability are part of our core values : We are a horizontal organization without bureaucracy (65% of staff are in tech roles) but optimal and reduced line management, focus on delivery and development while having a hybrid model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠Learn from inside an AI leader tech company : Join the 13th French Licorne providing hands on training, workshop and sessions with highly experienced AI research Team.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💶Your commitment, our investment : 1800€ gross monthly gratification, high&amp;nbsp; conversion rate to full time employee, dedicated HR partner, regular reviews and feedback sessions with your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍Be part of an international and diverse tech firm : Full english speaking environment with 55 different nationalities across the world and 11 offices locations (Paris, Singapore, Tokyo, Sao Paulo, Mexico City, Boston, Madrid, London, Toronto, Berlin...)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤝Dealing with big clients and developing business skills &amp;amp; knowledge : Real life experience with Insurance business challenges inside the world of AI.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is next ? 🎯&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If your application and experience meet our requirements, you can expect :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Talent Acquisition interview (30 min)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical interview 1 (60 min)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hiring manager interview (60 min)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The interview process can take 2 to 3 weeks, depending on the interviewer&#39;s availability. Be sure that we are doing our best to get back to you with an answer as fast as possible. If you are not getting an update on your application after 10 days, please reach out to our email address.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;To support our permanent, full time employees at every stage of their careers and lives, we provide a competitive total rewards and benefits package. Here are the global benefits we’d like to highlight:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Flexible remote and hybrid working options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary and a variable component tied to personal and company performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Multiple Learning and Development opportunities, including Focus Fridays, a half-day each month to focus on learning and personal growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO and paid holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Mental health benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;2 MAD Days per year (Make A Difference Days for paid volunteering)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Additional benefits may be offered by country, based on your eligibility - ask your recruiter for more information. Intern and Apprentice positions may receive some of these benefits - ask your recruiter for more details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI tools are used to help review applications for this role. Read our &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.shift-technology.com/hubfs/AI%20in%20Recruitment%20Notice%20May%202026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AI in Recruitment Notice&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;for what the AI considers, how to request a human review, and our most recent bias audit.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Shift we strive to be a diverse and inclusive workforce. &lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We welcome applications from and hire people who will contribute to the diversity of our company,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;without regard to race, color, religion, marital status, age, national or ethnic origin, physical or mental disability, medical condition, pregnancy, genetic information, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, or other non-merit criteria. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Shift Technology is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities in our application and employment process. Should you require accommodation, please email ----- and we will work with you to meet your accessibility needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please be aware of scammers and only trust correspondence that comes from emails ending in &quot;shift-technology.com&quot;. We will never do initial outreach to you via Whatsapp/Text/SMS, never ask for banking information or personal identification numbers (ex. Social Security Number) as part of our recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 8pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Shift Technology does not accept unsolicited CVs from recruiters or employment agencies in response to the Shift Technology Careers page or a Shift Technology social media post. Any unsolicited CVs, including those submitted directly to hiring managers, are deemed to be the property of Shift Technology. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Telesales · SumUp&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior CRM Administrator to join our Telesales Team. This is not a “keep-the-lights-on” role - it’s a seat at the table. You’ll work at the intersection of technology, process design, and people, shaping how our inbound and outbound telesales teams operate day to day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll contribute to our global Salesforce environment and, just as importantly, challenge the status quo, asking why a process works the way it does, finding the friction in how our reps sell, and rolling out tooling and automation that genuinely make a difference to the people using them. You’ll also work alongside the tools and partners that bring AI into our telesales setup, helping to evaluate, integrate, and get the best out of them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;If you love turning inefficient, manual workflows into elegant, well-integrated systems - and you know how to bring stakeholders along for the ride - this is your kind of role.&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive relevant and cross-team projects for process improvements across inbound and outbound telesales workflows, identifying friction points and designing scalable, well-integrated solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate, integrate, and get the best out of CRM-adjacent tooling - diallers, sequencing tools, conversation intelligence, and AI-powered solutions - working closely with the teams and vendors who build them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support key AI initiatives in the telesales setup - for example, contributing to the transition to a new AI calling provider, the rollout of a sales rep copilot, and conversational-insight tools that draw on calls, email, and chat - by handling the CRM integration, data flow, configuration, and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to continuously improving the day-to-day administration of our Salesforce telesales domain - automations, internal support agents, reporting, and data quality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with stakeholders across Sales, Revenue Operations, and Product - and, together with our Product Manager, translate business needs into effective CRM solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly and confidently - from writing requirements and documentation to presenting recommendations to sales management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse CRM data and usage patterns to surface insights, track adoption, and measure the impact of changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train and support end users, building a culture of CRM adoption and best practice across the telesales organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of the curve - keeping up with Salesforce releases, ecosystem tooling, and industry trends to continuously bring fresh ideas to the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience as a Salesforce Administrator, ideally in a sales or revenue operations environment, in a fast-paced setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical understanding of Salesforce Sales Cloud, automations, security/permissions, SOQL, and 3rd-party integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience integrating and working with 3rd-party tools - from scoping and designing secure data flows through to configuration and user adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to AI solutions in previous roles - whether 3rd-party AI tools or other solutions you helped evaluate, integrate, or roll out - and a genuine curiosity for how AI can improve sales workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SQL and analytics tooling allow you to not just fix problems, you use your analytical, process-improvement mindset to prevent them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management: you can navigate competing priorities and influence without authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear, confident communicator - equally comfortable writing a technical spec and presenting to a non-technical audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with telesales tooling, especially contact-centre and voice AI tooling (e.g. Aircall, Five9, Gong, claap.io, Outreach, MixMax, or similar) - with a track record of bringing out the best in the tools you work with.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read and write Apex and or lightning we components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of Salesforce integration options and REST APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant Salesforce, CRM, or AI related certifications (e.g. Advanced Admin, Sales Cloud Consultant, Salesforce Certified Agentforce Specialist).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-semibold-pgl7 cui-body-normal-pxkh cui-body-highlight-bbub css-10dm8y e173j6r82&quot;&gt;Why you should join SumUp:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;🌍 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office. This involves an office-first setup.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: Be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2,000 for attending conferences and/or advancing your career through further education.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our VSOP program: You will own a stake in SumUp’s future success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;💶 A corporate pension scheme where we match up to 20% of your contributions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;🔄 30 Days Sabbatical: Enjoy the unique opportunity to take a well-deserved break with our 30 days sabbatical benefit after completing 3 years of employment with SumUp.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: Earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;🚵🏾‍♂️ Numerous other benefits such as Urban Sports Club subsidy, Kita placement assistance, relocation assistance, subsidised office lunches.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in the everyday hero.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Small business owners are at the heart of all we do, so we create powerful, easy-to-use financial solutions to help them run their businesses. With a founder’s mentality and a &#39;team-first’ attitude, our diverse teams across Europe, South America, Australia and the United States work together to ensure that the small business owners we partner with can be successful doing what they love.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;SumUp is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer that proudly pursues and hires a diverse workforce. SumUp does not make hiring or employment decisions on the basis of race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. SumUp also strives for a healthy and safe workplace and strictly prohibits harassment of any kind.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;SumUp will not accept unsolicited resumes from any source other than directly from a candidate.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Technical Solutions Engineer at Diligent, you will play a critical role in supporting complex and enterprise pre-sales engagements by designing, prototyping, and demonstrating tailored GRC solutions. You will partner closely with Sales, Customer Success, Product, and Professional Services to translate sophisticated customer requirements into compelling technical solutions that accelerate deal velocity and drive technical wins.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who enjoys hands-on technical work, customer-facing problem solving, and building prototypes and automations that showcase how modern GRC platforms integrate into enterprise ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role operates on a hybrid model, with 50% office-based work required and is open to candidates based in London.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Regrettably we are unable to provide visa sponsorship, so you must be eligible to work in the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-Sales Technical Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales, and other members of the Solutions team to support mid-market and enterprise GRC opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical pre-sales win for assigned deals, including solution validation, design, and risk mitigation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deliver tailored demos, technical deep dives, and proof-of-concepts (POCs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Prototyping &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build demo prototypes, automation scripts, and integration examples using languages such as Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop solutions and workflows to demonstrate:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;o Data ingestion and transformation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;o API-based integrations&lt;/p&gt;
